  month     = nov,
  abstract  = {Leveraging advances in variational inference, we propose
                     to enhance recurrent neural networks with latent
                     variables, resulting in Stochastic Recurrent Networks
                     (STORNs). The model i) can be trained with stochastic
                     gradient methods, ii) allows structured and multi-modal
                     conditionals at each time step, iii) features a reliable
